          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اچھا (achchhā) goes back to Sanskrit accha, \"clear, transparent\" (CDIAL 142). CDIAL lists Hindi āchā, \"good\", and marks acchā itself as taken over from Punjabi. It adds that the Sanskrit word may once have meant \"shadowless\"."
            }
